## ⚡ QUICK START (5 seconds)

```
Project:   Portfolio Platform (Blazor WASM + ASP.NET Core + SQL Server)
Solution:  Portfolio.sln (3 projects: Web, Api, Data)
Stack:     Blazor WASM → HttpClient → ASP.NET Core API → Dapper → SQL Server
Auth:      JWT (Bearer token in LocalStorage)
DB:        Database-First, T-SQL in wwwroot/resources/, Dapper for access
UI:        Dark theme, Bento Grid 5-box, Gold #d4a04c accent
Run:       cd src/Portfolio.Api && dotnet run   |   cd src/Portfolio.Web && dotnet run
Login:     admin / Admin@123
```

