### Admin (JWT required — Admin or Editor)
```
GET    /api/admin/dashboard       → { TotalProjects, TotalSkills, UnreadMessages, ... }
GET    /api/admin/profile         → Profile object
PUT    /api/admin/profile         ← Profile object
GET    /api/admin/projects         → [ Project, ... ]
GET    /api/admin/projects/{id}   → Project + images
POST   /api/admin/projects         ← Project
PUT    /api/admin/projects/{id}   ← Project
DELETE /api/admin/projects/{id}
(Repeat pattern for: skills, experiences, testimonials)
GET    /api/admin/messages         → [ ContactMessage, ... ]  (?unreadOnly=true)
PUT    /api/admin/messages/{id}/read
DELETE /api/admin/messages/{id}
GET    /api/admin/settings         → [ { Key, Value }, ... ]
PUT    /api/admin/settings/{key}   ← "value"
GET    /api/admin/resources/history
