```

### Resource Runner (Admin for execute)
```
GET  /api/resources               → { files: [...], directory: "..." }
POST /api/resources/execute/{file} ← execute one SQL file → { status }
POST /api/resources/execute-all   ← execute all SQL files → { results: [...] }
GET  /api/resources/history       → execution log
```

### Error Logs (Admin only)
```
GET    /api/admin/errors          → { total, unresolved, items: [...] }  (?level, ?unresolved, ?page, ?pageSize)
PUT    /api/admin/errors/{id}/resolve
PUT    /api/admin/errors/resolve-all
DELETE /api/admin/errors/{id}
DELETE /api/admin/errors/clear
POST   /api/admin/errors/test     ← creates test error
```

