## 🚪 LANGUAGE GATE (first-visit language selection)

### Flow
```
First visit (no localStorage 'lang'):
  1. App.razor → <LanguageGate> wrapper
  2. T.LanguageSelected = false
  3. LanguageGate.razor renders premium selection screen
  4. User clicks 🇬🇧 or 🇮🇷
  5. T.SetLangAsync(lang) → saves to localStorage, loads JSON
  6. T.LanguageSelected = true
  7. LanguageGate removes itself → Router + full site renders

Return visit (localStorage has 'lang'):
  1. T.InitAsync() reads localStorage → LanguageSelected = true
  2. LanguageGate renders ChildContent immediately
  3. Full site loads with saved language — no gate shown
```

### Files
- `App.razor` — wraps entire `<Router>` in `<LanguageGate>`
- `Shared/LanguageGate.razor` — selection UI with flag options
- `Services/TranslationService.cs` — `LanguageSelected` property
- `wwwroot/lang/gate.html` — standalone HTML gate (for static preview)
- `wwwroot/index.html` — redirects to gate.html if no lang saved

### Static preview flow
```
index.html loads → checks localStorage
  → No 'lang' → redirect to /lang/gate.html → user selects → saved → back to /
  → Has 'lang' → stays on index.html, lang.js applies saved language
```
